---
import StoreLayout from '../layouts/StoreLayout.astro';
import Arrow from '../components/Arrow.astro';
import { site } from '../content/site';
---
<StoreLayout title="Our story — Engifto" description="The idea behind Engifto: thoughtful workspace essentials and small details for a more considered workday.">
  <section class="page-heading container"><p class="eyebrow">The idea behind Engifto</p><h1>Small details.<br /><em>A better everyday.</em></h1><p>{site.business.description}</p></section>
  <section class="about-store container"><img src="/images/story.webp" alt="A white desk with a notebook, lamp, and stationery in soft window light" width="1500" height="1000" fetchpriority="high" /><div class="prose"><h2>A little less noise.<br />A little more intention.</h2><p>A good notebook invites an idea. A well-placed lamp makes an evening feel softer. A small accent turns a desk into a place that feels like your own.</p><p>Engifto brings paper goods, desk lighting, and workspace accents together with a calm, uncomplicated shopping experience. The collection celebrates useful objects and the everyday moments around them.</p><h2>A space that feels like you.</h2><p>From the first note of the morning to the last task of the day, the things around you shape your routine. Our collection brings useful details into focus.</p><p>Mix paper, light, color, and texture to create a corner that feels personal. Start with one small detail, and make it your own.</p><a class="button" href="/shop">Explore the collection<Arrow /></a></div></section>
  <section class="container values-section"><div><span>01 / Useful by nature</span><h2>Everyday companions.</h2><p>Paper for ideas, light for focus, and accents that give your desk a little personality.</p></div><div><span>02 / Considered by design</span><h2>Room to breathe.</h2><p>A clear collection, simple navigation, and details you can explore at your own pace.</p></div><div><span>03 / Clear from the start</span><h2>Thoughtfully together.</h2><p>A collection that makes it easy to pair a daily essential with a small finishing touch.</p></div></section>
  <section class="business-section container" aria-labelledby="building-title"><div><p class="eyebrow">What we’re building</p><h2 id="building-title">A focused collection.<br /><em>A simpler experience.</em></h2><p>{site.business.building}</p><a href="/shop" class="text-link">Explore the storefront<Arrow diagonal /></a></div><dl><div><dt>Made for</dt><dd>{site.business.audience}</dd></div><div><dt>Our focus</dt><dd>Paper & writing, desk lighting, and desk accents.</dd></div><div><dt>Our purpose</dt><dd>{site.business.purpose}</dd></div>{site.contactEmail && <div><dt>Get in touch</dt><dd><a href={`mailto:${site.contactEmail}`}>{site.contactEmail}</a></dd></div>}</dl></section>
</StoreLayout>
